---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
import { USE_CASES } from '../../lib/use-cases';
---
<BaseLayout title={`实作案例：从样例到可下载的结果 - ${SITE.name}`} description="用真实导出文件了解 CloverTools：四叶草拼豆图纸、可复现机器人头像与嵌套 JSON 表格。每个案例都提供样例输入、参数、输出文件和复现步骤。" canonical={`${SITE.url}/examples/`} ads={false}>
  <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">首页</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>实作案例</span></nav>
  <header class="case-intro"><p class="eyebrow">CloverTools / 实作案例</p><h1>先看结果，再开始动手。</h1><p>从一份具体样例开始：下载素材，按公开参数操作，拿到可以使用的文件。这里提供了工具实际导出的图纸、头像和表格，以及操作时需要留意的细节。</p></header>
  <div class="case-list">{USE_CASES.map(item => <article><a class="case-art" href={`/examples/${item.slug}/`}>{item.image ? <img src={item.image} alt={item.imageAlt} width="520" height="360" loading="lazy" /> : <div class="case-data" aria-label="订单数据示例"><code>order, item, quantity</code><code>000123, 四叶草徽章, 2</code><code>000124, 小机器人贴纸, 1</code><span>嵌套对象与缺失字段也有各自的位置</span></div>}</a><div class="case-text"><p class="eyebrow">{item.summary}</p><h2><a href={`/examples/${item.slug}/`}>{item.title}</a></h2><p>{item.description}</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href={`/examples/${item.slug}/`}>查看样例与步骤 <i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div></article>)}</div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.case-intro{max-width:760px;padding:40px 0}.case-intro h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:12px 0 20px}.case-intro>p:last-child,.case-text>p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85}.eyebrow{color:var(--primary-dark);font:12px/1.6 var(--font-mono)}.case-list{display:grid;gap:28px;margin:0 0 64px}.case-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:var(--bg-elevated)}.case-art{display:flex;min-height:260px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--bg-secondary);padding:24px}.case-art img{display:block;width:100%;height:320px;object-fit:contain}.case-text{padding:clamp(22px,4vw,40px);align-self:center}.case-text h2{font-size:24px;line-height:1.4;margin:10px 0}.case-text .btn{margin-top:10px}.case-data{display:grid;gap:12px;min-width:0;font-size:clamp(10px,2vw,14px)}.case-data code{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.case-data span{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary)}@media(max-width:700px){.case-list article{grid-template-columns:1fr}.case-art img{height:240px}}
</style>
